    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. O&apos;Keeffe returns eight weeks after her third injection, the first extended interval. Her left-eye vision has held, with no new distortion, and daily Amsler checks of each eye show no change. Low-vision rehabilitation is complete: task lighting and a stand magnifier are set up in the studio, and high-contrast labels mark her paints and household controls. She is painting daily. The driving assessment cleared her for short local routes by day. She takes the AREDS2 supplement daily and has had no falls. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Left-eye vision stable over eight weeks; no new distortion</td></tr><tr><td>Amsler grid</td><td>Daily checks of each eye; no change</td></tr><tr><td>Low-vision rehabilitation</td><td>Task lighting, stand magnifier, and high-contrast labels in place</td></tr><tr><td>Driving</td><td>Cleared for short local routes by day</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Painting daily; independent at home; no falls</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

